{
  "name": "GTM AI Agent - Lead Enrichment & ICP Scoring",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GTM AI Agent\nInbound lead → research → ICP score → HubSpot + Slack/Discord.\n\n**Before activating**\n1. Attach credentials: Groq, Tavily (Header Auth), HubSpot App Token\n2. Paste your Slack/Discord webhook URL into the notification node\n3. Create the HubSpot custom properties (see README)\n4. Edit the ICP definition in the agent's system message",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        60
      ],
      "id": "f08c6e0d-1bc8-56f2-b8a1-65f44bd3ac9e",
      "name": "Note: Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Free-tier tip:** Groq's free tier has a tokens-per-minute cap. Max Iterations is 3 and the agent retries on failure. Send leads one at a time while testing.",
